Package: polaros-branding
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PolarOS Team <dev@polaros.dev>
Installed-Size: 24
Depends: fastfetch
Replaces: base-files
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/polaros
Description: PolarOS branding and identity files
 Installs the files that identify the system as PolarOS 1.0 (ARM64):
 /etc/os-release, /usr/lib/os-release, /etc/issue, /etc/issue.net,
 /etc/motd, the ASCII bear logo and the fastfetch configuration.
 .
 The bear is printed once per interactive shell session through
 /etc/profile.d/10-polaros-fastfetch.sh.
